WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.150
Your practice system runs on
Windows, or over Remote Desktop.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.910
noctune works there too.

00:00:06.587 --> 00:00:09.857
Pick the patient's note in the
noctune panel, beside the record.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.810
Click a field.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.500
Press Control Shift E.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.770
Subjective goes in.

00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:17.133
Each press, the next section.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.243
Objective.

00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:19.283
Assessment.

00:00:19.373 --> 00:00:20.123
Plan.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.120
Discharge instructions too.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.480
It only ever pastes.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.870
It never saves or sends anything for you.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.030
You read it, then Save in your PIMS.

00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:32.033
On the PC, over Remote Desktop or Citrix,

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.943
and in Chrome with the browser extension.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.977
noctune for Windows.
